   WITH     --shani-ink:var(--shani); --tekhelet-ink:var(--tekhelet); --press-wash:#dccbaa; --shesh:#561f86;
8) REPLACE  .pc-hudwrap .r-pills button[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--tekhelet-bold);
   WITH     .pc-hudwrap .r-pills button[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--tekhelet-ink);
9) REPLACE  .pc-hudwrap .r-overflow select.on { color: var(--tekhelet-bold);
   WITH     .pc-hudwrap .r-overflow select.on { color: var(--tekhelet-ink);
10) REPLACE own ink, the bold blue for a reading */
    WITH    own ink, the regular blue, worn bold, for a reading */
11) REPLACE #wcard .r-pills button[aria-pressed="true"] { color:var(--tekhelet-bold);
    WITH    #wcard .r-pills button[aria-pressed="true"] { color:var(--tekhelet-ink);
(The weights are already there: #wcard has font-weight:bold, and the .pc-hudwrap pair get 700 from the door's 'a pressed control is purple worn bold' rule.)

